'b50d7be6dcd32ee44bd8137e607da9a21fd18c363675c6a4e88358f40ddac863'}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_4', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '![Image](/home/anu/RAG_AI_ML_Projects/IKEA_Assembly_Instruction_Processing/data/markdown_files/billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1/billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_1_5_artifacts/image_000002_da673503ac792ed1a79f2d7b3345c1759def99fc06d377929c9d549eddbd0c51.png)', 'content': {'classification': 'Guidance', 'content_type': 'Warnings', 'description': 'Warning symbol displayed in assembly context', 'key_info': ['Tipping hazard – this product must be securely anchored', 'Use suitable screws and plugs for your home. If you are uncertain, seek professional advice.'], 'guidance': 'WARNING: Securely anchor the bookcase to wall. Use suitable screws and plugs. If unsure, seek professional advice before installation due to a tipping hazard.'}, 'type': 'image', 'image_id': 'da673503ac792ed1a79f2d7b3345c1759def99fc06d377929c9d549eddbd0c51'}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_5', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## English\n\n## WARNING!\n\nSerious or fatal crushing injuries can occur from furniture tip over. To prevent tip over this furniture must be used with the wall attachment device(s) provided.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_6', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Screw(s) and plug(s) for the wall are not included. Use screw(s) and plug(s) suitable for your walls. If you are uncertain, seek professional advice. Read and follow each step of the instruction carefully.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_7', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## Deutsch\n\n## ACHTUNG!\n\nWenn Möbelstücke umkippen, können ernste oder lebensgefährliche Verletzungen durch Einklemmen die Folge sein. Um zu verhindern, dass dieses Möbelstück umkippt, muss es mit der/den beigepackten Vorrichtung/ en zur Wandbefestigung fest an der Wand verankert werden.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_8', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Schraube(n) und Dübel für die Wand sind nicht im Lieferumfang enthalten. Befestigungsbeschläge benutzen, die für die heimischen Wände geeignet sind. Bei diesbezüglichen Fragen den örtlichen Fachhandel zu Rate ziehen. Jeden Schritt der Anleitung sorgfältig befolgen.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_9', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## Français\n\n## ATTENTION !\n\nRisque de blessure grave ou mortelle par écrasement en cas de chute du meuble. Pour éviter tout risque de CBTDVMFNFOU  DF NFVCMF EPJU ªUSF ԒY© BV NVS \xa0 MȃBJEF EFT ԒYBUJPOT JODMVTFT', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_10', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Les vis et chevilles pour le mur ne sont pas incluses. Utiliser des vis et des chevilles adaptées à votre type de mur. En cas de doute, demander conseil à un professionnel. Lire attentivement et suivre soigneusement chacune des étapes de ces instructions.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_11', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## Nederlands\n\n## WAARSCHUWING\n\nWanneer meubels omvallen, kan er ernstig of levensbedreigend beklemmingsletsel ontstaan.Zorg ervoor dat het meubel aan de wand is bevestigd met de bijgevoegde onderdelen om te voorkomen dat het omvalt.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_12', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Schroeven en pluggen voor de wand zijn niet inbegrepen. Gebruik schroeven en pluggen die geschikt zijn voor je muur. Vraag om professioneel advies als je niet zeker weet welke schroeven of pluggen te gebruiken. Lees en volg elke stap van de instructies zorgvuldig.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_13', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## Dansk\n\n## ADVARSEL!', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_14', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Der kan opstå alvorlig eller livsfarlig tilskadekomst, hvis møblet vælter. For at undgå, at møblet vælter, skal det fastgøres til væggen med de(t) medfølgende vægbeslag. Skrue(r) og rawlplug(s) medfølger ikke. Brug skrue(r)/rawlplug(s), som er beregnet til væggene i dit hjem. Kontakt en fagmand, hvis du er i tvivl. Læs og følg alle trin i anvisningerne omhyggeligt.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_15', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## Íslenska\n\n## VARÚÐ!\n\nAlvarlegt slys eða dauðsfall getur orðið\n\nef húsgagn fellur fram fyrir sig.\n\nTil að draga úr hættu á að húsgagnið falli fram fyrir sig þarf að festa það við vegg með meðfylgjandi veggfestingum.\n\nSkrúfur og veggtappar eru ekki innifalin. Notaðu skrúfur og veggtappa sem henta veggjum heimilisins. Leitaðu ráða hjá fagaðila ef þú ert ekki viss.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_16', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '-FTUV MFJ°CFJOJOHBSOBS PH GZMHEV IWFSKV TLSFԒ þeirra vandlega.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_17', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## Norsk\n\n## ADVARSEL!\n\nAlvorlige og potensielt dødelige ulykker kan skje som følge av møbler som velter. For å hindre at det velter, skal dette møbelet kun brukes med veggfestene som følger med.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_18', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Skruer og plugger til vegg er ikke inkludert. Bruk festemidler som passer til materialene i veggen din. Rådfør deg med fagfolk dersom du er usikker. Les og følg hvert trinn i instruksene nøye.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_19', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## Suomi\n\n## VAROITUS!\n\nKalusteen kaatuminen voi aiheuttaa vakavia tai kuolettavia murskavammoja. Kaatumisen estämiseksi tätä kalustetta tulee käyttää vain mukana tulevien seinäkiinniketarvikkeiden kanssa.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_20', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Seinäruuvit ja -tulpat myydään erikseen. Käytä seinääsi sopivia ruuveja ja tulppia. Jos olet epävarma, kysy apua asiantuntijalta. Lue ja noudata ohjeen jokaista vaihetta huolellisesti.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_21', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## Svenska\n\n## VARNING!\n\nAllvarliga eller livsfarliga klämskador kan uppstå från möbler som välter. För att förhindra att möbeln välter måste den användas med medföljande väggfäste.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_22', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Skruv och plugg för väggen ingår inte. Använd skruv och plugg som passar dina väggar. Om du är osäker, sök professionell rådgivning. Läs och följ varje steg i anvisningen noga.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_23', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## ÌFTLZ\n\n## 610;03/Ú/ԣ\n\n; EĮWPEV QĘFWSĽFO\xad O¡CZULV NĮĽF EPK\xadU\n\nL W¡ĽO½N OFCP TNSUFMO½N [SBOÛO\xadN "CZ OFEPĠMP L QĘFWSĽFO\xad UPIPUP O¡CZULV  NVT\xad C½U QPVĽ\xadW¡O T EPEBO½N [BĘ\xad[FO\xadN QSP QĘJQFWOÛO\xad OB [FÏ', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_24', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'ğSPVCZ B INPĽEJOLZ L QĘJQFWOÛO\xad EP [EJ OFKTPV TPVÍ¡TU\xad W½SPCLV  1PVĽJKUF ĠSPVCZ B INPĽEJOLZ WIPEO© QSP WBĠF TUÛOZ  1PLVE si nejste jisti, vyhledejte odbornou pomoc. 1FÍMJWÛ TJ QĘFÍUÛUF B EPESĽVKUF KFEOPUMJW© LSPLZ W NPOU¡ĽO\xadN O¡WPEV', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_25', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## Español\n\n## ¡ADVERTENCIA!\n\nSi un mueble vuelca, puede provocar daños de aplastamiento graves o fatales. Para evitar que vuelque, este mueble se debe usar con el/los EJTQPTJUJWPT EF ԒKBDJ³O B MB QBSFE RVF se incluyen.\n\nNo se incluyen los tornillos ni tacos de pared. Utiliza tornillos y tacos adecuados para tus paredes. En caso de duda, busca asesoramiento profesional. Lee y sigue cada paso de las instrucciones cuidadosamente.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_26', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '![Image](/home/anu/RAG_AI_ML_Projects/IKEA_Assembly_Instruction_Processing/data/markdown_files/billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1/billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_1_5_artifacts/image_000003_f214d7d7fef508131939145e7b807c2f68fb87d64989737aac1fa5a1b3c678f1.png)', 'content': {'classification': 'Guidance', 'content_type': 'Warnings', 'description': 'Warning triangle symbol indicating safety hazard.', 'key_info': [], 'guidance': 'WARNING! Tipping hazard – this product must be securely anchored. Use suitable screws and plugs for your home. If you are uncertain, seek professional advice.'}, 'type': 'image', 'image_id': 'f214d7d7fef508131939145e7b807c2f68fb87d64989737aac1fa5a1b3c678f1'}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_27', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## Italiano\n\n## AVVERTENZA!\n\nSe il mobile si ribalta può causare lesioni da schiacciamento gravi o mortali. Per evitare che questo mobile TJ SJCBMUJ  EFWF FTTFSF ԒTTBUP BMMB QBSFUF DPO JM J DPNQPOFOUF J EJ ԒTTBHHJP incluso/i.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_28', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Le viti e i tasselli per la parete non sono inclusi. Usa viti e tasselli adatti alle tue pareti. Se hai dubbi, rivolgiti a un esperto. Leggi e segui attentamente ogni passaggio delle istruzioni.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_29', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## Magyar\n\n## FIGYELMEZTETÉS\n\nA bútorok felborulása végzetes balesetet okozhat. A bútor GFMCPSVM¡TB NFHFMĐ[IFUĐ B NFMM©LFMU T[FSFMW©OZFLLFM WBM³ GBMIP[ S¶H[\xadU©TTFM', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_30', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Az ehhez szükséges csavarokat és a tipliket a csomag nem tartalmazza. Mindig a falad U\xadQVT¡OBL NFHGFMFMĐ DTBWBSPLBU ©T UJQMJLFU használd. Ha kérdés merülne fel benned ezzel LBQDTPMBUCBO  L©SE LJ T[BL©SUĐ W©MFN©OZ©U Figyelmesen olvasd el és kövesd a használati útmutatót.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_31', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## Polski\n\n## 0453;&amp;ĺ&amp;/ԡ&amp;\n\n/B TLVUFL QS[FXS³DFOJB TJÙ NFCMB NPĻF EPKĚD EP QPXBĻOZDI MVC ĚNJFSUFMOZDI PCSBĻFă  "CZ [BQPCJFD QS[FXS³DFOJV TJÙ UFHP NFCMB  OBMFĻZ HP VĻZXBÇ [ EPāÅD[POZNJ NPDPXBOJBNJ EP ĚDJBOZ', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_32', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'ęSVCZ J LPāLJ EP ĚDJBOZ OJF TÅ EPāÅD[POF EP [FTUBXV  6ĻZK XLSÙU³X J LPāL³X PEQPXJFEOJDI EP EBOFHP SPE[BKV ĚDJBO  8 SB[JF XÅUQMJXPĚDJ OBMFĻZ [BTJÙHOÅÇ QPSBEZ QSPGFTKPOBMJTUZ 1S[FD[ZUBK JTUSVLDKÙ J QPTUÙQVK EPLāBEOJF [ LBĻEZN KFK QVOLUFN', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_33', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## Eesti\n\n## HOIATUS!\n\nMööbli ümberkukkumine võib põhjustada tõsiseid või surmavaid vigastusi. Selleks et mööblieseme ümberkukkumine ära hoida, tuleb seda kasutada koos kaasasolevate seinakinnitustega.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_34', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Kruvid ja tüüblid ei kuulu komplekti. Kasuta oma kodu seintele sobivaid kruve ja tüübleid. Kui sa pole kindel, milliseid, võta ühendust asjatundjaga. Loe juhiseid ja järgi hoolikalt iga sammu.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_35', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## Latviešu\n\n## #3ԯ%ԡ/ÀԴ6.4\n\n.ÓCFMFT BQHÁĽPUJFT WBS SBEëU OÁWÓKPĠBT USBVNBT  -BJ OPWÓSTUV NÓCFûV BQHÁĠBOPT  UÁT KÁQJFTUJQSJOB QJF TJFOBT BS LPNQMFLUÁ JFLûBVUP TUJQSJOÁKVNV JFLûBVUBKJFN TUJQSJOÁKVNJFN', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_36', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '4LSĪWFT VO EëCFûJ LPNQMFLUÁ OBW JFLûBVUJ ԡ[NBOUP UÁEBT TLSĪWFT VO EëCFûVT  LBT JS QJFNÓSPUJ UBWB NÁKPLûB TJFOÁN  ԴB ëTUJ OF[JOJ LÁEBT JS QJFNÓSPUÁLÁT TLSĪWFT VO EëCFûJ  WBJDÁ TQFDJÁMJTUBN  ԡFWÓSP MJFUPĠBOBT JOUSVLDJKBT OPSÁEëKVNVT', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_37', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## -JFUVWJĲ\n\n## \u053041ÖԴԡ."4\n\n6ĽWJSUÙ CBMEBJ HBMJ SJNUBJ BS OFU NJSUJOBJ TVĽBMPUJ  ,BE ĠJT CBMEBT OFVĽWJSTUĲ  Kï SFJLJB QSJUWJSUJOUJ QSJF TJFOPT OBVEPKBOU SJOLJOZKF FTBOÍJVT laikiklius.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_38', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '5WJSUJOJNP QSJF TJFOPT EFUBMJĲ  WBSĽUĲ JS LBJĠÍJĲ  SJOLJOZKF O×SB  3JOLJU×T KBT QBHBM TBWP OBNĲ TJFOĲ UJQÅ  ԴFJ LJMT LMBVTJNĲ  LSFJQLJU×T QBUBSJNP ï TQFDJBMJTUVT  -BJLZLJU×T WJTĲ JOTUSVLDJKĲ', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_39', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## Portugues\n\n## AVISO!\n\n"T RVFEBT EF N³WFJT QPEFN originar lesões graves ou fatais por esmagamento. Para prevenir a RVFEB  ԒYF FTUF N³WFM \xa0 QBSFEF DPN P BDFTT³SJP EF ԒYB§£P GPSOFDJEP', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_40', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '/£P FTU£P JODMV\xadEPT QBSBGVTP OFN CVDIBT Use parafusos e buchas adequados às suas paredes. Caso não tenha a certeza, peça ajuda a um técnico. Leia e siga cuidadosamente as instruções.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_41', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## Româna\n\n## AVERTISMENT!\n\n3ÃTUVSOBSFB QJFTFMPS EF NPCJMJFS QPBUF cauza accidente grave sau fatale.\n\n1FOUSV B QSFWFOJ SÃTUVSOBSFB  BDFTU NPCJMJFS USFCVJF TÃ ԒF ԒYBU EF QFSFUF GPMPTJOE BDDFTPSJJMF EF ԒYBSF GVSOJ[BUF', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_42', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': "ĝVSVCVSJMF ĞJ EJCMVSJMF QFOUSV QFSFUF OV TVOU JODMVTF  'PMPTFĞUF ĞVSVCVSJ ĞJ EJCMVSJ QPUSJWJUF QFOUSV QFSF͈JJ UÃJ  %BDÃ OV FĞUJ TJHVS  TPMJDJUÃ BKVUPS DBMJԒDBU  $JUFĞUF ĞJ VSNFB[Ã ԒFDBSF QBT EJO JOTUSVD͈JVOJ DV BUFO͈JF", 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_43', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## Slovensky\n\n## UPOZORNENIE\n\n1SFWS¡UFOJF O¡CZULV N´ĽF NBĤ [B O¡TMFEPL W¡ĽOF BMFCP TNSUFýO© zranenie. Aby ste zabránili prevrhnutiu, NVT\xad CZĤ O¡CZUPL WĽEZ QSJQFWOFO½ k stene pomocou kovania, ktoré je TºÍBTĤPV CBMFOJB', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_44', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '4LSVULZ B INPĽEJOLZ OJF Tº TºÍBTĤPV CBMFOJB 1PVĽJUF TLSVULZ B INPĽEJOLZ WIPEO© EP W¡ĠIP UZQV TUFOZ  "L TJ OJF TUF JTU\xad  PQ½UBKUF TB PECPSO\xadLPW  1SFÍ\xadUBKUF TJ B E´LMBEOF EPESĽJBWBKUF LBĽE½ LSPL W O¡WPEF', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_45', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## ƨǡǒǊǇǗǘǑǏ\n\n## ƩƴƯƳƧƴƯƬ\n\nƸǌǗǏǕǎǔǏ ǏǒǏ ǛǇǙǇǒǔǏ ǔǇǗǇǔǦǉǇǔǏǦ ǕǙ ǘǓǇǞǑǉǇǔǌ ǓǕǊǇǙ ǋǇ ǔǇǘǙǡǖǦǙ ǖǗǏ ǖǗǌǕǈǗǡǠǇǔǌ ǔǇ ǓǌǈǌǒǏ  ƮǇ ǋǇ ǖǗǌǋǕǙǉǗǇǙǏǙǌ ǖǗǌǕǈǗǡǠǇǔǌǙǕ ǔǇ ǇǗǙǏǑǚǒǇ Ǡǌ ǙǗǦǈǉǇ ǋǇ ǊǕ ǓǕǔǙǏǗǇǙǌ ǘ ǖǗǏǒǕǍǌǔǏǦ Ǚǌ  ǉ ǖǇǑǌǙǇ ǘǙǌǔǌǔ ǔǏ  ǌǒǌǓǌǔǙ Ǐ', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_46', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'ƩǑǒǥǞǌǔ Ǐ  ǌ ǘǇ  ǉǏǔǙ Ǖǉǌ  Ǐ ǋǥǈǌǒ Ǐ  ǎǇ ǘǙǌǔǌǔ ǓǕǔǙǇǍ  ƯǎǖǕǒǎǉǇǐǙǌ ǉǏǔǙ Ǖǉǌ  Ǐ ǋǥǈǌǒ Ǐ   ǑǕǏǙǕ ǘǇ ǖǕǋǜǕǋǦǠǏ ǎǇ ǉǇǟǇǙǇ ǘǙǌǔǇ  ƧǑǕ ǔǌ ǘǙǌ ǘǏǊǚǗǔǏ  ǖǕǏǘǑǇǐǙǌ ǘǡǉǌǙ ǕǙ ǖǗǕǛǌǘǏǕǔǇǒǏǘǙ  ƩǔǏǓǇǙǌǒǔǕ ǖǗǕǞǌǙǌǙǌ Ǐ ǘǒǌǋǉǇǐǙǌ ǉǘǦǑǇ ǏǔǘǙǗǚǑǝǏǦ', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_47', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## Hrvatski\n\n## 610;03&amp;/Դ&amp;\n\n/BNKFĠUBK LPKJ TF QSFWSOF NPĽF uzrokovati ozbiljne ili smrtonosne ozljede.\n\n,BLP CJ TF POF TQSJKFÍJMF QPUSFCOP KF QSJÍWSTUJUJ OBNKFĠUBK OB [JE T QPNPÇV QSJMPĽFOJI [JEOJI QSJÍWSTOJLB\n\n7JKDJ J UJQMF [B [JE OJTV QSJMPĽFOJ  ,PSJTUJUJ WJKLF J UJQMF QSJLMBEOF [B [JEPWF  6 TMVÍBKV OFTJHVSOPTUJ QSJ SVLPWBOKV BMBUPN  QPUSBĽJUJ QSPGFTJPOBMOV QPNPÇ  1BĽMKJWP QSPÍJUBUJ J QSBUJUJ svaki korak uputa.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_48', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '![Image](/home/anu/RAG_AI_ML_Projects/IKEA_Assembly_Instruction_Processing/data/markdown_files/billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1/billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_1_5_artifacts/image_000004_640fa18aa382226529d0c57d8589f8df024d7d89b26ce2fcce8d59a95a465be3.png)', 'content': {'classification': 'Guidance', 'content_type': 'Warnings', 'description': 'Product image displays a warning symbol inside an equilateral triangle with an exclamation mark.', 'key_info': ['⚠️ Warning symbol visible'], 'guidance': 'Warning about tipping hazard – anchor required. Secure to wall or use suitable screws and plugs.'}, 'type': 'image', 'image_id': '640fa18aa382226529d0c57d8589f8df024d7d89b26ce2fcce8d59a95a465be3'}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_49', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## ŠƅƅƁƇƃƄŶ\n\n## ūŬŪŠ ז şŪūŪ ז ŢŭŢ\n\nŧƊƉƋſŹ ƇŻ ƊƋƉƄƅƁƂƉƗƇ ƍƉżŻƋƉŹ Ÿ ƂŻƇŶƍƃƆƉƃ ƎƋŻƏƆŻƎƃƍƆƉŹ ŻƊƖ ŻƇŻƎƋƉƊŸ ƎƉƏ ſƊŹƊƅƉƏ  ŞƃŻ ƇŻ ŻƊƉƎƋŷƒſƎſ ƎƁƇ ŻƇŻƎƋƉƊŸ ƎƉƏ ſƊŹƊƅƉƏ ƊƋŷƊſƃ ƇŻ ƑƋƁƍƃƆƉƊƉƃſŹƎſ ƎŻ ſƈŻƋƎŸƆŻƎŻ ƍƎſƋŷƓƍƁƌ ƊƉƏ ƊŻƋŷƑƉƇƎŻƃ', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_50', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Ūƃ żŹžſƌ ƄŻƃ ƎŻ ƉƗƊŻ ŽƃŻ ƎƉƇ ƎƉŹƑƉ žſƇ ƊſƋƃƅŻƆżŶƇƉƇƎŻƃ  ŨŻ ƑƋƁƍƃƆƉƊƉƃſŹƎſ Ǝƃƌ żŹžſƌ ƄŻƃ ƎŻ ƉƗƊŻ ƊƉƏ ſŹƇŻƃ ƄŻƎŶƅƅƁƅŻ ŽƃŻ ƎƉ ƏƅƃƄƖ ƎƉƏ ƎƉŹƑƉƏ ƍŻƌ  ŜƇ žſƇ ſŹƍƎſ ƍŹŽƉƏƋƉƃ ŻƇŻƀƁƎŸƍƎſ żƉŸƂſƃŻ ŻƊƖ ſƊŻŽŽſƅƆŻƎŹŻ şƃŻżŶƍƎſ ƄŻƃ ŻƄƉƅƉƏƂŸƍƎſ ƄŶƂſ żŸƆŻ ŻƊƖ Ǝƃƌ ƉžƁŽŹſƌ ƊƋƉƍſƄƎƃƄŶ', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_51', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## ƷǚǘǘǑǏǐ\n\n## ƩƴƯƳƧƴƯƬ\n\nƵǖǗǕǑǏǋǢǉǇǔǏǌ ǓǌǈǌǒǏ ǓǕǍǌǙ ǘǙǇǙǣ ǖǗǏǞǏǔǕǐ ǖǕǒǚǞǌǔǏǦ ǘǌǗǣǌǎǔǢǜ ǙǗǇǉǓ ǏǒǏ ǋǇǍǌ ǖǗǏǉǌǘǙǏ Ǒ ǘǓǌǗǙǏ  ƾǙǕǈǢ ǖǗǌǋǕǙǉǗǇǙǏǙǣ ǕǖǗǕǑǏǋǢǉǇǔǏǌ  ǔǌǕǈǜǕǋǏǓǕ ǕǈǌǘǖǌǞǏǙǣ ǘǙǇǝǏǕǔǇǗǔǕǌ ǑǗǌǖǒǌǔǏǌ ǓǌǈǌǒǏ Ǒ ǘǙǌǔǌ ǘ ǖǕǓǕǠǣǥ ǖǗǏǒǇǊǇǥǠǏǜǘǦ ǑǗǌǖǌǍǔǢǜ ǇǑǘǌǘǘǚǇǗǕǉ', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_52', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'ƿǚǗǚǖ   Ǣ  Ǐ ǋǥǈǌǒǣ   Ǐ  ǋǒǦ ǘǙǌǔ ǔǌ ǖǗǏǒǇǊǇǥǙǘǦ  ƯǘǖǕǒǣǎǚǐǙǌ ǟǚǗǚǖǢ Ǐ ǋǥǈǌǒǏ  ǖǕǋǜǕǋǦǠǏǌ ǋǒǦ ǑǕǔǑǗǌǙǔǕǊǕ ǙǏǖǇ ǘǙǌǔ ǉ ǉǇǟǌǓ ǖǕǓǌǠǌǔǏǏ  ƶǗǏ ǉǕǎǔǏǑǔǕǉǌǔǏǏ ǑǇǑǏǜ ǒǏǈǕ ǉǕǖǗǕǘǕǉ ǕǈǗǇǙǏǙǌǘǣ Ǒ ǘǖǌǝǏǇǒǏǘǙǚ  ƩǔǏǓǇǙǌǒǣǔǕ ǖǗǕǞǏǙǇǐǙǌ ǏǔǘǙǗǚǑǝǏǥ Ǐ ǘǒǌǋǚǐǙǌ ǉǘǌǓ ǏǎǒǕǍǌǔǔǢǓ ǉ ǔǌǐ ǗǌǑǕǓǌǔǋǇǝǏǦǓ', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_53', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## :ǑǗǇǭǔǘǣǑǇ\n\n## ƺƩƧƪƧ\n\nƶǌǗǌǑǏǋǇǔǔǦ ǓǌǈǒǬǉ ǓǕǍǌ ǘǖǗǏǞǏǔǏǙǏ ǘǌǗǐǕǎǔǬ ǇǈǕ ǘǓǌǗǙǌǒǣǔǬ ǙǗǇǉǓǏ  ǀǕǈ ǓǌǈǒǬ ǔǌ ǖǌǗǌǑǏǔǚǒǏǘǣ ǔǌǕǈǜǬǋǔǕ ǖǗǏǑǗǬǖǏǙǏ ǭǜ ǋǕ ǘǙǬǔǏ ǋǌǙǇǒǦǓǏ  ǠǕ ǋǕǋǇǥǙǣǘǦ', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_54', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'ƪǉǏǔǙǏ ǙǇ ǟǚǗǚǖǏ ǔǌ ǋǕǋǇǥǙǣǘǦ ƩǏǑǕǗǏǘǙǕǉǚǐǙǌ ǊǉǏǔǙǏ ǙǇ ǟǚǗǚǖǏ  ǦǑǬ ǖǬǋǜǕǋǦǙǣ ǉǇǟǕǓǚ ǙǏǖǚ ǘǙǬǔ  ǆǑǠǕ ǉǏ ǔǌ ǉǖǌǉǔǌǔǬ  ǎǉǌǗǔǬǙǣǘǦ ǎǇ ǋǕǖǕǓǕǊǕǥ ǋǕ ǛǇǜǬǉǝǦ  ƺǉǇǍǔǕ ǖǗǕǞǏǙǇǐǙǌ ǙǇ ǋǕǙǗǏǓǚǐǙǌǘǣ ǬǔǘǙǗǚǑǝǬǐ', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_55', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## Srpski\n\n## 610;03&amp;/Դ&amp; OPASNOST OD 13&amp;735"/Դ"\n\n1SFWSUBOKF OBNFĠUBKB NPĽF JNBUJ ozbiljne ili smrtne posledice.\n\n%B TF TQSFÍJ QSFWSUBOKF  OBNFĠUBK NPSB CJUJ USBKOP QSJÍWSĠÇFO [B [JE QPNPÇV elementa ili elemenata koji se dobija ili dobijaju uz proizvod.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_56', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Zavrtnji i tiplovi ne dobijaju se uz proizvod. Koristi zavrtnje i tiplove koji odgovaraju NBUFSJKBMV PE LPH KF [JE  "LP JNBĠ EJMFNV PCSBUJ TF TUSVÍOPN MJDV  1BĽMKJWP QSPÍJUBK PWB VQVUTUWB J QSJESĽBWBK JI TF', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_57', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## 4MPWFOĠÍJOB\n\n## OPOZORILO!\n\nÌF TF QPIJĠUWP QSFWSOF  MBILP QSJEF do hudih telesnih poškodb ali smrti. Da se pohištvo ne bi prevrnilo, ga je USFCB QSJUSEJUJ OB TUFOP T QSJMPĽFOJNJ okovjem.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_58', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '7JKBLJ JO [JEOJ WMPĽLJ OJTP QSJMPĽFOJ  6QPSBCJ WJKBLF JO [JEOF WMPĽLF  LJ TJ QSJNFSOJ [B TUFOF W tvojem domu. Za nasvet glede primerne vrste WJKBLPW TF PCSOJ OB TUSPLPWOKBLB  1P[PSOP QSFCFSJ OBWPEJMB JO KJI EPTMFEOP VQPĠUFWBK', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_59', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## Türkçe\n\n## UYARI!\n\n.PCJMZBOԹO EFWSJMNFTJOEFO kaynaklanabilecek ölümcül ezilmeler veya ciddi yaralanmalar meydana HFMFCJMJS  .PCJMZBOԹO EFWSJMNFTJOJ önlemek için duvara sabitlenmelidir.\n\n7JEB MBS  WF E¼CFM MFS  QBLFUF EBIJM EFßJMEJS %VWBSMBSԹOԹ[B VZHVO WJEB MBSԹ  WF E¼CFM MFSJ LVMMBOԹO  &amp;NJO EFßJMTFOJ[ QSPGFTZPOFM UBWTJZF BMԹO  5BMJNBUԹO IFS BEԹNԹOԹ EJLLBUMF PLVZVO WF VZHVMBZԹO', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_60', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'ਭↇ\n\n## 䝥။屏\n\nា൷ాఒ\u0ff0㳻ଚ\u17fc㷲ਥ䷍ㄘ㷱㷲ၾ㊂ྌତ ࢽ \u0a3a刲❠❢ា൷ాఒ寲䟶ຢᯅ\u0b7fㄦ剄ᨦῐ\u0b9b㊂ ਊᒙዺរ䵍\u0af6 ࢽ\n\nਊᒙㄦ㊂䎸傉\u0a0e䎸ᑞ匀\u0fe7ᔖ䤬ੰ ࢽ 䟶\u0b7fㄦ䰁ဉᲨ ᒙᓁ㊂䎸傉ႍ䎸ᑞ ࢽ ᖂ⎚\u0a0d㑬រ寲䟶\u17fb⡀ਓਚᴏ 䗀 ࢽ 䟶\u0ad4㫄刅䟺᩶䱴᮪䟳∎㊂⟍ਪ❣嚣 ࢽ', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_61', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '㲙ಌ\n\n## 䦿ኦ幘\n\n䄼ᨒ࿓༜\u0e70ቌ乻\u206cᔐ倧༕ᨏ\u2072䁌ዙ幰ᄶḡෞ ㎀㍺ጝ咞㓜౩ゞᕖ᧶䜵㷆敽仚ྪ༜\u0e70ᇎ唄敼\n\n䘑㯊የᚭ㿸\u171d♫啚ቃ䭕幰䤤ෞ㎀仄ብᨒಌゞ喼㓜 䘑㯊የᚭ㿸\u171d♫幰䄼\u0dbf౬㜒᧶ゞ喼▨䭃敽䤤㻇㮹 ᩤ⟅ങጽ幰䤤ള㮈吋䧙ಅ\u0dfc⾿㮜䜵䤃⑩᧥䜵敼', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_62', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '⎎᭢⁝\n\n## ⅟\u20f2\n\n\u1aec᭡\u1aec ᰶ⁝Ↄ ᬱ₹ ≄ḨΩ\u20f9 ễὈ⃦ \u20ff⃦ ᾩ ℁ῑᲒᲜ  \u1aec᭡\u1aec ᰶ⁝ⅿᲅ ᬘ⃦ ₆ṿ⎌ᮋ ⃒⎕ὠᲅ Ṷᴆ\u1fd4 \u1aec᭡ᷡ ấ\u206e ấᬸℭ ℐ≄ᶫ ᬸℭ\u1fd4≴⁎ ⎒ᲒᲜ', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_63', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'ᰏἼₚ ≑ỡᶍ⃥ ⍖⎑᳨ⅿ ‹ῑᲒᲜ  ấ\u206e ᷽ᲅ ᰏἼₚ ≑ỡᶍ⃦ Ἴ₸⎌Ὧ₱  ⁝ᴱ ⅇᷖᷡ Ἴ₸⎕⁎ ⎌ᲅⅿ ᭬ᮆ⎌\u1fd4ᲜḤ ℧ṇ\u1aec\u206eᬟ ṇ\u20f2⎌Ὧ₱  \u1aed Ჟᬳᷡ ⅟\u20f2 ᮖᬟ \u20fbᬸ ᴜᵲ ⅟Ὧ₱', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_64', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## ᄎᆇ\u1c4c\n\n## Ლୋ⇳\n\nൠ\u0a0d࠻ᵯঔ࠸ࡕࡗ ߹ ൠ\u0a0d࠻ ࣆ ტࠚ࠸࠷࠰࠳ ದࡵࡰ ߹ ࠏࡘࠑ࠼ᖦ\u0b59࠸࠘࠘\u085cࡘࡕࠓ࠷\u09c6 ൝\u085f\u1ccfࠓ૫\u1f4e࠙ࠏࡗࡋࠦ ߺ ൠ\u0a0d࠻ᵯঔ\u085fἰ ࠝࠬࡎ ߹ णඳ࠻ఀ\u0d51ᖪ\u0895 ࢼ ࢈\u085fफ़࠰࠳ൠ\u0a0d \u085fࠤ࠰࠘ࡗ࠵౻࠸ఀ\u0d51ࠤ࠳ࠜ࠭ࠢࠑ ߺ', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_65', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '౻ఀ\u0d51ᖪ࠻\u0891ࡼ ࢻ \u0897ࡽ࠼\u0b3bࡋ࡙࠳ࠑࡋࠨࡠ ߺ \u0b0e ࡗणࠞᾮ࠻ᆗ\u1cfb࠸ḃࠤࠬ\u0891ࡼ ࢻ \u0897ࡽࡑఀ\u0d51\u0a0d\u085f फ़ᖪࠤ࠳ࠜ࠭ࠢࠑ ࣇߺ ᄞ࠷ᒙ࠙ࠏࡘ\u0c54ଫ࠼ ߹ ඇ ἂൠ࠘ࡖ࠻ࡦࢍ\u0894ࡨࡽ\u085f\u0ecf࠳ࠜ࠭ࠢࠑ ߺ ᱔ᄞᅭ \u085fᛀ᱆ࠤ࿚῞࠸፱࠰࠳ᷢࡎ࠳ࠜ࠭ࠢࠑ ߺ', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_66', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## Bahasa Indonesia\n\n## PERINGATAN!\n\nTertimpa perabot yang terjungkir dapat menyababkan cedera serius atau fatal. Untuk mencegah perabot terjungkir, perabot harus menggunakan perangkat pengencang dinding yang disediakan.\n\nSekrup dan baut jangkar untuk dinding tidak termasuk. Gunakan sekrup dan baut jangkar yang cocok untuk dinding Anda. Jika Anda tidak yakin, minta saran dari profesional. Baca dan ikuti setiap petunjuk dengan saksama.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_67', 'page_number': 5, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '![Image](/home/anu/RAG_AI_ML_Projects/IKEA_Assembly_Instruction_Processing/data/markdown_files/billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1/billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_1_5_artifacts/image_000005_9318b59a8c62c0e2ae19c311f8380ae2470125e2070529be6a16f5a1ee21b65f.png)', 'content': {'classification': 'Assembly', 'step_name': 'Safety Check', 'action': '1. Insert screw ↓\n2. Align arrow ↑ to top\n3. Get assistance – heavy component', 'parts': [{'id': '104325', 'name': 'screw', 'quantity': 'Unclear'}], 'tools': ['hammer (included)'], 'safety': 'Safety Guidelines', 'difficulty': ['Medium']}, 'type': 'image', 'image_id': '9318b59a8c62c0e2ae19c311f8380ae2470125e2070529be6a16f5a1ee21b65f'}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_68', 'page_number': 5, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## Bahasa Malaysia\n\n## AMARAN!\n\nKecederaan himpitan yang serius atau yang membawa maut boleh berlaku akibat daripada perabot yang rebah. Untuk mengelakkan daripada rebah, perabot ini mesti digunakan dengan alat sambungan dinding yang disediakan.\n\nTidak termasuk skru dan palam untuk dinding. Gunakan skru dan palam yang sesuai untuk dinding anda. Jika anda tidak pasti, dapatkan nasihat profesional. Baca dan ikuti setiap langkah arahan secara teliti.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_69', 'page_number': 5, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1', 'image_file_path': '![Image](/home/anu/RAG_AI_ML_Projects/IKEA_Assembly_Instruction_Processing/data/markdown_files/billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1/billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_1_5_artifacts/image_000006_55eef78f5dc339d7fe0cbed62edb06bd557cefc1775b2f51a4ead8e29f0f1ac6.png)', 'content': {'classification': 'Guidance', 'content_type': 'No Info', 'description': "Text symbols only (Arabic script 'عربي تحذير')", 'key_info': [], 'guidance': 'No assembly information available'}, 'type': 'image', 'image_id': '55eef78f5dc339d7fe0cbed62edb06bd557cefc1775b2f51a4ead8e29f0f1ac6'}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2292949-2-1_chunk_70', 'page_number': 5, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bo