 'No assembly information available'}, 'type': 'image', 'image_id': '2739c2bd83de467adefc29c592d93b952a12b587352e96623506657aff1beb52'}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_4', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '![Image](/home/anu/RAG_AI_ML_Projects/IKEA_Assembly_Instruction_Processing/data/markdown_files/billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100/billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_1_5_artifacts/image_000002_52d981256d6dd3b2bd39aa9637884c481255c286e44607ab33a1c71a0d495c04.png)', 'content': {'classification': 'Guidance', 'content_type': 'Warnings', 'description': 'Product image displaying a warning symbol ⚠️ indicating tipping hazard.', 'key_info': [], 'guidance': 'WARNING! Tipping hazard – this product must be securely anchored.'}, 'type': 'image', 'image_id': '52d981256d6dd3b2bd39aa9637884c481255c286e44607ab33a1c71a0d495c04'}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_5', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## English\n\nImportant information\n\nRead carefully', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_6', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Follow each step of the instruction carefully Keep this information for further reference\n\n## WARNING\n\nSerious or fatal crushing injuries can occur from furniture tip-over. To prevent this furniture from tipping over it must be permanently fixed to the wall with the included wall attachment devices.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_7', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Fastening devices for the wall are not included since different wall materials require different types of fastening devices. Use fastening devices suitable for the walls in your home. For advice on suitable fastening devices, contact your local specialized dealer.\n\n## Deutsch\n\nWichtige Information\n\nSorgfältig lesen', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_8', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Jeden Schritt der Anleitung sorgfältig befolgen Diese Information aufbewahren\n\n## ACHTUNG\n\nWenn Möbelstücke umkippen, können ernste oder lebensgefährliche Verletzungen durch Einklemmen die Folge sein. Um zu verhindern, dass dieses Möbelstück umkippt, muss es mit der beigepackten Vorrichtung zur Wandbefestigung fest an der Wand verankert werden.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_9', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Beschläge für die Wandbefestigung sind nicht beigepackt, da sie von der Beschaffenheit der Wand und des Untergrundmaterials abhängig sind. Befestigungsbeschläge benutzen, die für die heimischen Wände geeignet sind. Bei diesbezüglichen Fragen den örtlichen Fachhandel zu Rate ziehen.\n\n## Français\n\nInformation importante\n\nÀ lire attentivement.\n\nSuivez bien les instructions étape par étape.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_10', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': "Conserver ces informations pour une utilisation ultérieure.\n\n## ATTENTION\n\nRisque de blessure grave ou mortelle en cas de basculement du meuble. Pour éviter que le meuble ne bascule, il faut le fixer au mur de façon permanente à l'aide des pièces pour fixation incluses.", 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_11', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Les vis ne sont pas incluses car leur choix dépend du matériau du mur sur lequel est fixé le meuble. Utilisez des vis adaptées au matériau du mur. Pour obtenir des conseils sur les vis à utiliser, adressez-vous à un vendeur spécialisé.\n\n## Nederlands\n\nBelangrijke informatie\n\nGoed lezen\n\nVolg elke stap in de aanwijzingen zorgvuldig', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_12', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Bewaar deze informatie voor toekomstig gebruik\n\n## WAARSCHUWING\n\nWanneer meubels omvallen, kan er ernstig of levensbedreigend beklemmingsletsel ontstaan. Om te voorkomen dat dit meubel omvalt, dient dit permanent met de meegeleverde wandbevestigingen aan de wand te worden bevestigd.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_13', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Bevestigingsbeslag voor de wand is niet inbegrepen, aangezien verschillende wandmaterialen verschillende soorten bevestigingsbeslag vereisen. Gebruik bevestigingsbeslag dat geschikt is voor de wanden in je huis. Voor advies over geschikt bevestigingsbeslag, neem contact op met de vakhandel.\n\n## Dansk\n\nVigtige oplysninger\n\nLæs omhyggeligt', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_14', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Følg de enkelte trin i anvisningerne omhyggeligt Gem disse oplysninger til senere brug\n\n## ADVARSEL!\n\nDer kan opstå alvorlig eller livsfarlig tilskadekomst, hvis møblet vælter. For at undgå, at møblet vælter, skal det fastgøres permanent til væggen med de medfølgende vægbeslag.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_15', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Forskellige vægmaterialer kræver forskellige skruer og rawlplugs. Medfølger ikke. Brug skruer og rawlplugs, der passer til væggene i dit hjem. Hvis du er i tvivl om, hvilken type skruer/ rawlplugs du skal bruge, skal du kontakte et byggemarked.\n\n## Íslenska\n\nMikilvægar upplýsingar Lestu vandlega Fylgdu hverju skrefi leiðbeininganna vandlega', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_16', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Geymdu upplýsingarnar\n\n## VARÚÐ\n\nAlvarleg eða banvæn slys geta átt sér stað ef húsgagn fellur fram fyrir sig. Til að koma í veg fyrir að húsgagnið falli fram fyrir sig þarf að festa það við vegg með meðfylgjandi áhöldum fyrir veggfestingar.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_17', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Festingar fylgja ekki því veggefni getur verið mismunandi og þurfa mismunandi festingar. Notaðu festingar sem henta veggefni heimilisins. Leitaðu upplýsinga varðandi hentugar veggfestingar í byggingavöruverslun.\n\n## Norsk\n\nViktig informasjon\n\nLes nøye', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_18', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Følg alle stegene i denne instruksen nøye Spar på disse instruksene for fremtidig bruk.\n\n## ADVARSEL\n\nAlvorlige og potensielt dødelige ulykker kan skje som følge av møbler som velter. For å forhindre at dette møbelet velter, må det festes permanent til veggen med det inkluderte festebeslaget.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_19', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Festemidler for vegg er ikke inkludert fordi ulike vegger krever ulike festemidler. Bruk festemidler som er beregnet for veggene i hjemmet ditt. Kontakt din nærmeste jernvarehandel for råd om festemidler.\n\n## Suomi\n\nTärkeää tietoa\n\nLue huolellisesti.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_20', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Seuraa jokaista ohjeen vaihetta huolellisesti. Säilytä mahdollista myöhempää tarvetta varten.\n\n## VAROITUS\n\nHuonekalun kaatuminen voi aiheuttaa vakavia tai kuolemaan johtavia vammoja. Kaatumisen estämiseksi huonekalu täytyy kiinnittää pysyvästi seinään mukana tulevalla kaatumisesteellä.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_21', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Pakkaus ei sisällä seinään kiinnittämistä varten tarvittavia ruuveja ja tulppia, koska erilaisia seinämateriaaleja varten tarvitaan erilaiset kiinnikkeet. Valitse kiinnikkeet kotisi seinämateriaalin mukaan. Apua oikeanlaisten kiinnikkeiden valintaan voit kysyä rautakaupasta.\n\n## Svenska\n\nViktig information\n\nLäs noga\n\nFölj varje steg i anvisningen noga', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_22', 'page_number': 2, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Spara denna information för framtida bruk\n\n## VARNING\n\nAllvarliga eller livsfarliga klämskador kan ske om möbler tippar över. För att förhindra att den här möbeln tippar över måste den fästas permanent vid väggen med medföljande väggfästningsanordningar.\n\nFästbeslag för väggen medföljer inte eftersom olika väggmaterial kräver olika typer av fästbeslag. Använd fästbeslag som passar för väggarna hemma hos dig. För råd om lämpliga fästbeslag, kontakta din fackhandlare.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_23', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '![Image](/home/anu/RAG_AI_ML_Projects/IKEA_Assembly_Instruction_Processing/data/markdown_files/billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100/billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_1_5_artifacts/image_000003_7511c93dfc4eb50b8efbb5bd9618a008fab141b764dd6efd903258ed35739470.png)', 'content': {'classification': 'Guidance', 'content_type': 'Warnings', 'description': 'Warning symbol on a white background indicating safety hazard.', 'key_info': ['WARNING! Tipping hazard'], 'guidance': 'Refer to product details for assembly instructions. This image only displays a safety warning.'}, 'type': 'image', 'image_id': '7511c93dfc4eb50b8efbb5bd9618a008fab141b764dd6efd903258ed35739470'}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_24', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## Česky', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_25', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Důležitá informace Čtěte pozorně. Postupujte dle jednotlivých kroků. Uschovejte pro pozdější popužití.\n\n## VAROVÁNÍ\n\nPokud se nábytek převrhne, může dojít k velmi vážným nebo dokonce fatálním poraněním. Abyste převržení nábytku zabránili, musíte ho natrvalo připevnit ke stěně.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_26', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Upevňovací materiál není součástí balení, protože se liší v závislosti na materiálu stěny. Používejte tedy takový upevňovací materiál, který je vhodný na stěny u vás doma. Pokud se potřebujete poradit, obraťte se na místního odborníka.\n\n## Español\n\nInformación importante\n\nLeer detenidamente.\n\nSigue cada paso de las instrucciones atentamente.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_27', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Guarda esta información para consultarla en el futuro.\n\n## ADVERTENCIA\n\nPueden producirse lesiones graves o fatales si vuelca un mueble. Para evitar que vuelque, debe fijarse permanentemente a la pared con los dispositivos de fijación a la pared que se incluyen.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_28', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'No se incluyen los dispositivos de fijación, dado que los diversos materiales de pared requieren diferentes herrajes de fijación. Usa herrajes adecuados para el material de las paredes de tu casa. Para saber cuáles son los herrajes adecuados, pide consejo en tu ferretería habitual.\n\n## Italiano\n\nInformazioni importanti.\n\nLeggi attentamente.\n\nSegui attentamente tutti i passaggi delle istruzioni.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_29', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': "Conserva queste informazioni per ulteriori consultazioni.\n\n## AVVERTENZA\n\nSe il mobile si ribalta può causare lesioni da compressione serie o fatali. Per prevenire il rischio che il mobile si ribalti, quest'ultimo deve essere fissato permanentemente alla parete con i componenti di sicurezza inclusi.", 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_30', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Viti e tasselli per il fissaggio alla parete non sono inclusi perché pareti di materiali diversi richiedono tipi diversi di accessori di fissaggio. Usa sistemi di fissaggio adatti alle pareti della tua casa. Per maggiori dettagli sugli accessori di fissaggio, rivolgiti a un rivenditore specializzato.\n\n## Magyar', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_31', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Fontos információ Kérjük, olvasd el alaposan Tartsd meg ezt az információt a jövőre nézve\n\n## FIGYELEM!\n\nA bútor felborulása súlyos, vagy akár végzetes sérülést okozhat. Ahhoz, hogy megakadályozd, hogy ez a bútor felboruljon, a bútort megfelelően a falhoz kell rögzíteni a mellékelt fali rögzítő tartozékokkal.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_32', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'A falba rögzítéshez szükséges kellékek nincsenek a csomagban, mivel a különböző típusú falakhoz különböző rögzítő eszközökre van szükség. Mindig az otthoni fal típusának megfelelő szerelvényeket használj! A megfelelő rögzítőrendszerek kiválasztásához fordulj segítségért a helyi szaküzletek munkatársaihoz.\n\n## Polski\n\nWażna informacja\n\nPrzeczytaj uważnie\n\nPostępuj dokładnie zgodnie z każdym punktem niniejszej instrukcji', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_33', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Zachowaj te informacje do wykorzystania w przyszłośći\n\n## OSTRZEŻENIE\n\nPrzewrócenie mebla może prowadzić do poważnych lub śmiertelnych obrażeń w wyniku przygniecenia. Aby zapobiec przewróceniu się mebla należy go trwale przymocować do ściany za pomocą dołączonych urządzeń łączących do ściany.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_34', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Mocowania do ściany nie są dołączone, ponieważ różne rodzaje ścian wymagają różnych mocowań. Stosuj mocowania odpowiednie do ścian w swoim domu. Aby uzyskać informacje na temat odpowiednich mocowań skontaktuj się z lokalnym sklepem specjalistycznym.\n\n## Eesti\n\nOluline teave\n\nLugege hoolikalt', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_35', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Säilitage see teave hilisema vajaduse tarbeks.\n\n## HOIATUS\n\nMööbli ümberkukkumisel võivad kaasneda tõsised või surmaga lõppevad vigastused. Mööbli ümberkukkumise vältimiseks tuleb mööbel jäädavalt kinnitada seina külge kaasasolevate vahenditega.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_36', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Seinakinnitusvahendid ei kuulu komplekti, sest erinevate materjalidega tuleb kasutada erinevaid kinnitusvahendeid. Valige alati enda seinamaterjalile sobivad kinnitusvahendid. Sobivate kinnitusvahendite leidmiseks võtke ühendust spetsialistiga.\n\n## Latviešu\n\nSvarīga informācija\n\nRūpīgi izlasiet.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_37', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Rūpīgi ievērojiet visus uzstādīšanas norādījumus. Saglabājiet šo informāciju turpmākai uzziņai.\n\n## BRĪDINĀJUMS\n\nMēbeles apgāšanās var radīt smagas vai nāvējošas traumas. Lai šī mēbele neapgāztos, tā ir jāpiestiprina pie sienas.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_38', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Sienas stiprinājumi mēbeles piestiprināšanai pie sienas nav iekļauti komplektā, jo tie jāizvēlas atkarībā no sienas materiāla. Izmantojiet stiprinājumus, kas ir piemēroti jūsu mājokļa sienām. Ja nezināt, kādus stiprinājumus izmantot, konsultējieties ar būvniecības speciālistu.\n\n## Lietuvių', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_39', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Svarbi informacija Atidžiai perskaitykite Laikykitės nurodymų Išsaugokite šias instrukcijas ateičiai\n\n## PERSPĖJIMAS\n\nJei baldai užvirstų, kiltų rimtų sužalojimų ar net mirtinas pavojus, todėl baldus reikia pritvirtinti prie sienų specialiais laikikliais, kuriuos gausite kartu su baldais.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_40', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Skirtingoms sienoms reikalingos skirtingos tvirtinimo detalės, todėl jų reikia įsigyti atskirai. Rinkitės savo namų sienoms tinkančias tvirtinimo detales. Kilus abejonių, kurios tinkamiausios, kreipkitės į specializuotos parduotuvės darbuotojus patarimo.\n\n## Portugues\n\nInformações importantes!\n\nLeia estas instruções cuidadosamente.\n\nSiga cada passo das instruções cuidadosamente.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_41', 'page_number': 3, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Guarde estas informações para referência futura.\n\n## AVISO\n\nAs quedas de móveis podem originar lesões graves ou fatais por esmagamento. Para evitar que este móvel caia, deve ser fixado à parede de forma permanente com as ferragens de fixação à parede incluídas.\n\nAs ferragens de fixação à parede não estão incluídas porque diferentes tipos de parede requerem diferentes tipos de ferragens. Utilize ferragens adequadas às paredes da sua casa. Se não tiver a certeza do tipo de ferragem a utilizar, consulte uma loja da especialidade.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_42', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '![Image](/home/anu/RAG_AI_ML_Projects/IKEA_Assembly_Instruction_Processing/data/markdown_files/billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100/billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_1_5_artifacts/image_000004_52d981256d6dd3b2bd39aa9637884c481255c286e44607ab33a1c71a0d495c04.png)', 'content': {'classification': 'Guidance', 'content_type': 'Warnings', 'description': 'Warning symbol displayed on image', 'key_info': ['WARNING! Tipping hazard – this product must be securely anchored.', 'Use suitable screws and plugs for your home. If you are uncertain, seek professional advice.'], 'guidance': 'Refer to Safety Guidelines section for proper anchoring requirements before use.'}, 'type': 'image', 'image_id': '52d981256d6dd3b2bd39aa9637884c481255c286e44607ab33a1c71a0d495c04'}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_43', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '## Româna\n\nInformaţii importante\n\nCiteşte cu atenţie.\n\nUrmează instrucţiunile.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_44', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Păstrează aceste informaţii pentru referinţe ulterioare.\n\n## ATENŢIE!\n\nPot surveni răni grave dacă te împiedici de obiectele de mobilier. Pentru prevenirea rănirilor, fixează mobila pe perete, cu accesoriile incluse.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_45', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Accesoriile de fixare pentru perete nu sunt incluse deoarece materialele diferite din care sunt făcuţi pereţii au nevoie de accesorii diferite de fixare. Foloseşte accesoriile de fixare potrivite pentru pereţii camerei tale. Contactează un specialist dacă nu ştii care sunt accesoriile potrivite pereţilor casei tale.\n\n## Slovensky\n\nDôležité informácie!\n\nČitajte pozorne.\n\nJe dôležité dôkladne dodržiavať každý krok uvedený v návode.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_46', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Informácie si uschovajte pre prípad potreby.\n\n## UPOZORNENIE\n\nPrevrhnutie nábytku môže spôsobiť vážne či smrteľné zranenia. Aby sa predišlo prevrhnutiu nábytku, pripevnite ho k stene pribaleným upevňovacím zariadením.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_47', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Upevňovací materiál nie je súčasťou balenia, pretože na každý materiál steny je potrebné použiť iný typ skrutky a hmoždinky. Použite upevňovací materiál vhodný na konkrétny typ materiálu, z ktorého je vaša stena. V prípade potreby sa poraďte so špecializovaným predajcom.\n\n## Български\n\nВажна информация\n\nПрочетете внимателно\n\nСледвайте всяка стъпка от инструкцията внимателно', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_48', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Запазете тази информация за справка\n\n## ВНИМАНИЕ\n\nСериозни или фатални травми могат да бъдат причинени при преобръщане на мебелите. За да предотвратите преобръщането на тази мебел, тя трябва да бъде постоянно закрепена за стената с включените крепежни елементи за стенен монтаж.\n\nМонтажните елементи за стената не са включени, тъй като различните стенни материали изискват различни видове монтажни елементи. Използвайте монтажни елементи, които са подходящи за стените', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_49', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'във вашия дом. За съвет относно подходящи монтажни елементи се обърнете към местния специализиран търговец.\n\n## Hrvatski\n\nVažne informacije\n\nPažljivo pročitati', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_50', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Pažljivo pratiti svaki korak uputa za sastavljanje Sačuvati ove informacije za buduće potrebe\n\n## UPOZORENJE\n\nAko se namještaj prevrne, može doći do ozbiljnih ili smrtonosnih ozljeda.\n\nKako bi se izbjeglo prevrtanje, namještaj mora biti pričvršćen za zid priloženim pričvrsnicima za zid.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_51', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'S obzirom na to da različite vrste zidova zahtijevaju upotrebu različitih vrsta okova za pričvršćivanje (vijci i tiple), oni nisu priloženi. Upotrijebiti okove za pričvršćivanje prikladne za zidove doma. Za savjet o prikladnim vrstama okova za pričvršćivanje, kontaktirati lokalnu specijaliziranu trgovinu.\n\n## Ελληνικά\n\nΣημαντική πληροφορία\n\nΔιαβάστε προσεκτικά\n\nΑκολουθήστε κάθε βήμα των οδηγιών προσεκτικά', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_52', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Φυλάξτε αυτή την πληροφορία για μελλοντική αναφορά\n\n## ΠΡΟΕΙΔΟΠΟΙΗΣΗ\n\nΣοβαροί ή μοιραίοι τραυματισμοί μπορεί να συμβούν από την ανατροπή επίπλου. Για να αποφύγετε την ανατροπή αυτού του επίπλου, πρέπει να στερεώνεται μόνιμα στον τοίχο με τα εξαρτήματα στήριξης που περιλαμβάνονται.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_53', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Τα εξαρτήματα στερέωσης στον τοίχο δεν περιλαμβάνονται, καθώς τα διαφορετικά υλικά τοίχων απαιτούν και διαφορετικούς τύπους εξαρτημάτων στερέωσης. Χρησιμοποιήστε εξαρτήματα στερέωσης κατάλληλα για τους τοίχους του σπιτιού σας. Για πληροφορίες σχετικά με τα κατάλληλα εξαρτήματα στερέωσης, συμβουλευθείτε το ειδικό κατάστημα της περιοχής σας.\n\n## Yкраїнська\n\nВажливо\n\nПрочитайте уважно\n\nНеобхідно ретельно дотримуватись всіх\n\nрекомендацій, зазначених в інструкції\n\nЗберігайте цю інформацію для подальшого', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_54', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'використання\n\n## ПОПЕРЕДЖЕННЯ\n\nПерекидання меблів може спричинити серйозне або смертельне травмування людини. Щоб запобігти перекиданню цих\n\nмеблів, їх слід міцно прикріпити до стіни за допомогою механізмів, що додаються.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_55', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Кріплення до стіни не додаються, оскільки різні матеріали стін потребують різних кріплень. Використовуйте механізми кріплення відповідно матеріалу стін. За консультацією щодо належних систем кріплення звертайтесь до найближчого спеціалізованого магазину.\n\n## Srpski\n\nVažne informacije\n\nPročitaj pažljivo\n\nPažljivo se pridržavaj svakog koraka ovih uputstava', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_56', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Sačuvaj ovo uputstvo za buduće potrebe\n\n## UPOZORENJE. OPASNOST OD PREVRTANJA.\n\nPrevrtanje nameštaja može izazvati ozbiljne ili smrtonosne ozlede. Da se nameštaj ne bi prevrnuo, mora biti trajno pričvršćen za zid propisanom opremom za pričvršćivanje koja se dobija uz proizvod.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_57', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Zavrtnji i tiplovi ne dobijaju se uz proizvod jer isti zavrtnji i tiplovi ne odgovaraju raznim vrstama zidova. Upotrebi pribor koji odgovara zidovima u tvojem domu. Potraži savet u specijalizovanoj prodavnici.\n\n## Slovenščina\n\nPomembni podatki\n\nPozorno preberi\n\nNatančno upoštevaj vsak korak, opisan v navodilih', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_58', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Shrani ta navodila za kasnejšo uporabo.\n\n## OPOZORILO!\n\nPrevrnitev pohištva lahko privede do hudih telesnih poškodb ali smrti. Da se pohištvo ne bi prevrnilo, ga je treba trajno pritrditi na steno s priloženim okovjem.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_59', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Ker se stenski materiali razlikujejo, pritrdilni elementi niso priloženi. Vedno uporabi pritrdilne elemente, ki so primerni za določen material. Za nasvet glede primerne vrste pritrdilnih elementov se obrni na najbližjo specializirano trgovino.\n\n## Türkçe\n\nÖnemli bilgiler\n\nDikkatle okuyunuz\n\nTalimatların her adımını dikkatlice uygulayınız', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_60', 'page_number': 4, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'İleride gerekebileceği için bu bilgileri saklayınız\n\n## UYARI\n\nMobilyanın devrilmesi sonucu ölümcül veya ciddi yaralanmalar meydana', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_61', 'page_number': 5, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '![Image](/home/anu/RAG_AI_ML_Projects/IKEA_Assembly_Instruction_Processing/data/markdown_files/billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100/billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_1_5_artifacts/image_000005_7511c93dfc4eb50b8efbb5bd9618a008fab141b764dd6efd903258ed35739470.png)', 'content': {'classification': 'Guidance', 'content_type': 'Warnings', 'description': 'Warning symbol displayed on image', 'key_info': [], 'guidance': '⚠️ WARNING! Tipping hazard – this product must be securely anchored. Use suitable screws and plugs for your home. If you are uncertain, seek professional advice.'}, 'type': 'image', 'image_id': '7511c93dfc4eb50b8efbb5bd9618a008fab141b764dd6efd903258ed35739470'}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_62', 'page_number': 5, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'gelebilir. Devrilme riskini önlemek için mobilyanın, ürüne dahil olan aparat ile duvara sabitlenmesi gerekmektedir.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_63', 'page_number': 5, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Duvar yapı malzemeleri farklılık gösterebileceğinden, mobilyanın duvara sabitlenmesi için gereken bağlantı parçaları ürüne dahil değildir. Evinizin duvar yapı malzemesine uygun bağlantı parçaları seçiniz. Duvar yapı malzemenize uygun bağlantı parçaları satın almak için en yakın yapı market ya da bir nalbur dükkanından bilgi alabilirsiniz.\n\n## 中文', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_64', 'page_number': 5, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '重要信息 请仔细阅读 请严格遵照说明步骤操作 保留此信息，以备日后参考\n\n## 警告\n\n家具倾倒可能导致严重或致命伤害。必须使 用产品包装内的墙壁安装件将家具固定在墙 上，防止倾倒。', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_65', 'page_number': 5, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '不同材质的墙壁需使用不同类型的固定装置，因此包 装内不含墙壁固定装置。请选用适合家中墙壁的固定 装置。欲获取适用固定装置的相关建议，请联系当地 的专业零售商。\n\n## 繁中\n\n重要資訊 請仔細閱讀。 請依照說明書內步驟操作。', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_66', 'page_number': 5, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '請妥善保存此說明書，以供參考。\n\n## 警告\n\n請留意家具傾倒可能造成的嚴重傷害。請用 產品附的上牆固定裝置將家具固定在牆上， 以免發生傾倒的危險。', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_67', 'page_number': 5, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '因牆壁材質不同，產品不含上牆用螺絲和配件。請選 用適合家中牆壁材質的上牆配件(需另購)。如有任何 疑問，請洽詢服務人員。\n\n## 한국어\n\n중요한 정보. 꼼꼼히 읽어주세요. 설명서 각 단계 내용을 잘 따라주세요.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_68', 'page_number': 5, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '추후 참고를 위해 설명서를 잘 보관해 주세요.\n\n## 경고\n\n가구가 넘어지면 심각한 부상이 발생할 수 있습니다. 가구가 넘어지는 것을 예방하려면 제품에 동봉된 고정 부품을 이용하여 반드시 벽에 고정시켜야 합니다.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_69', 'page_number': 5, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '벽마다 소재가 다르기 때문에 벽 고정용 나사는 포함되어 있지 않습니다. 가구를 설치할 벽 소재에 맞는 나사를 사용하여 고정하셔야 합니다. 적합한 나사 선택에 대해서는 전문가에게 문의해 주세요.\n\n## 日本語\n\nこの説明書には重要な情報が含まれています よくお読みになり、正しくご使用ください 説明書の手順にそって組み立て・設置を行ってく ださい', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_70', 'page_number': 5, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'この説明書はいつでも参照できるよう大切に保管し てください\n\n## 警告\n\n家具の転倒により、家具の下敷きになって 大ケガ、あるいは生命にかかわるような傷 害を負う危険があります。家具の転倒を防 ぐため、付属の壁固定具で家具をしっかり と壁に固定してください。', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_71', 'page_number': 5, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': '壁の材質により使用できるネジの種類が異なるた め、専用の取り付けネジは含まれていません。壁の 材質に適したネジをご使用ください。取り付けに 適したネジに関しては、お近くの専門店にご相談く ださい。\n\n## Bahasa Indonesia\n\nInformasi penting\n\nBaca dengan hati-hati', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_72', 'page_number': 5, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Simpan petunjuk ini untuk referensi lebih lanjut\n\n## PERINGATAN\n\nCedera serius atau fatal dapat terjadi akibat perabot terbalik. Untuk menghindari perabot dari terbalik, harus ditempelkan secara permanen ke dinding dengan alat pemasang dinding yang sudah termasuk.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_73', 'page_number': 5, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Alat pengencang pada dinding tidak termasuk karena bahan dinding yang bervariasi membutuhkan jenis alat pengencang yang berbeda. Gunakan alat pengencang yang sesuai dengan dinding Anda di rumah. Untuk saran mengenai sistem pengencangan yang sesuai, hubungi ahli bangunan di daerah Anda.\n\n## Bahasa Malaysia\n\nMaklumat penting\n\nBaca dengan teliti', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_74', 'page_number': 5, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Ikuti setiap langkah arahan dengan berhati-hati Simpan maklumat ini untuk rujukan selanjutnya\n\n## AMARAN\n\nKecederaan serius atau himpitan yang membawa maut boleh berlaku akibat perabot rebah. Untuk mengelakkan perabot ini daripada rebah ia mestilah dipasang secara kekal pada dinding dengan alat pengancing dinding yang disertakan.', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_75', 'page_number': 5, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'Alat pengancing untuk dinding tidak disertakan kerana bahan dinding yang berbeza-beza memerlukan jenis pengancing yang berbezabeza. Gunakan alatan pengancing yang sesuai untuk dinding di rumah anda. Untuk nasihat mengenai alat pengancing yang sesuai, hubungi peniaga khusus setempat anda.\n\n## عربي\n\nمعلومات هامة يرجى القراءة بعناية', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_76', 'page_number': 5, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'يرجى الإحتفاظ بهذه المعلومات للرجوع إليها مستقبلاً\n\n## تحذير\n\nقد تحدث إصابات بالغة أو مميتة نتيجة إنهيار أو إنقلاب الأثاث. لمنع هذا الأثاث من الإنهيار يجب تثبيته دائما ً  على الحائط بإستخدام أجهزة التثبيت الحائطية المرفقة.\n\nأدوات التثبيت على الحائط غير متضمنة وذلك لأن هناك أنواعا ً  مختلفة من الحوائط وهي تتطلب', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_77', 'page_number': 5, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'أنواعا ً  مختلفة من أدوات التثبيت. يرجى استخدام أدوات تثبيت مناسبة لحائط منزلك. لطلب النصيحة حول نظام التثبيت المناسب، اتصل على ايكيا.\n\n## ไทย\n\nข้้อมููลสำำ�คััญ กรุุณ�อ่�นอย่่�งละเอีย่ด แล้วปฏิิบััติิติ�มูทีีละข้ั�นติอน', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_78', 'page_number': 5, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '', 'content': 'และเก็บัข้้อมููลนี�ไว้\n\n## คำำ�เตืือน\n\nห�กเฟอร์์นิเจอร์์ล้้มหร์ือโคำ่นล้งม� อ�จก่อให้เกิด ก�ร์บ�ดเจ็บส�หัสหร์ืออันตืร์�ยถึึงชีีวิิตืได้ เพื่ื�อ ป้้องกันอุบัตืิเหตืุเฟอร์์นิเจอร์์ล้้มหร์ือโคำ่น ตื้องยึด เฟอร์์นิเจอร์์ตืิดผนังให้แน่นหน� โดยใชี้อุป้กร์ณ์์ ยึดที�ให้ม�ด้วิย\n\nสำกรุูทีี�ใช้้ย่ึดเข้้�กับัผนังไมู่ได้ให้้มู�ในชุ้ดอุปกรุณ์ปรุะกอบั เพรุ�ะ วัสำดุผนังข้องแติ่ละบั้�นแติกติ่�งกัน จึึงติ้องเลือกใช้้สำกรุูช้นิด ทีี�เห้มู�ะกับัวัสำดุผนังนั�น ห้�กไมู่แน่ใจึว่�คัวรุเลือกใช้้สำกรุูช้นิดใด กรุุณ�สำอบัถ�มูรุ้�นจึำ�ห้น่�ย่อุปกรุณ์ใกล้บั้�น', 'type': 'text', 'image_id': ''}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_79', 'page_number': 6, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '![Image](/home/anu/RAG_AI_ML_Projects/IKEA_Assembly_Instruction_Processing/data/markdown_files/billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100/billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_6_10_artifacts/image_000000_1d032730e82d8aed23692e23799d982c9e7b0aae17b753ca6dcbe30b7b433c60.png)', 'content': {'classification': 'Guidance', 'content_type': 'Warnings', 'description': 'Image shows warning symbols next to screw types (plus and minus), indicating correct vs incorrect usage or compatibility.', 'key_info': ['Use plus sign (+) for correct application', 'Avoid cross mark (X) symbol'], 'guidance': 'Review screw type symbols in image; ensure correct fasteners are used for the BILLY bookcase assembly.'}, 'type': 'image', 'image_id': '1d032730e82d8aed23692e23799d982c9e7b0aae17b753ca6dcbe30b7b433c60'}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_80', 'page_number': 6, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '![Image](/home/anu/RAG_AI_ML_Projects/IKEA_Assembly_Instruction_Processing/data/markdown_files/billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100/billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_6_10_artifacts/image_000001_ecb4a3f5cc472e9280d22ba26f74b3e1688ff08a564fc78fcf40451f958ca5b3.png)', 'content': '![Image](/home/anu/RAG_AI_ML_Projects/IKEA_Assembly_Instruction_Processing/data/markdown_files/billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100/billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_6_10_artifacts/image_000001_ecb4a3f5cc472e9280d22ba26f74b3e1688ff08a564fc78fcf40451f958ca5b3.png)', 'type': 'image', 'image_id': 'ecb4a3f5cc472e9280d22ba26f74b3e1688ff08a564fc78fcf40451f958ca5b3'}, {'chunk_id': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100_chunk_81', 'page_number': 6, 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'billy-bookcase-black-oak-effect__AA-2545155-1-100', 'image_file_path': '![Ima