ticleboard, Paper foil, Acrylic paint \n Door \n Stile: \n Fibreboard, Paper foil, Plastic edging, Paper foil, Plastic edging \n Rail/ Door panel: \n Fibreboard, Paper foil', 'Care Instructions': 'Bookcase/height extension unit \n Wipe clean with a cloth dampened in a mild cleaner. \n Wipe dry with a clean cloth.', 'Safety and compliance': 'WARNING! Tipping hazard – this product must be securely anchored.  Use suitable screws and plugs for your home. If you are uncertain, seek professional advice.', 'product_name': 'BILLY / OXBERG Bookcase w doors/extension unit', 'product_color': 'black oak effect', 'product_dimensions': '80x41x237 cm', 'product_category': 'Bookcases & shelving units', 'article_number': '104.773.65', 'assembly_instruction_file_name': 'oxberg-door-black-oak-effect__AA-1003268-8-2'})
